WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:18.886
"You found the shirt?" Henry exclaimed. "Where is it?"

2
00:00:18.887 --> 00:00:20.551
Maggie grinned.

3
00:00:20.552 --> 00:00:25.872
"On TV, detectives always want to examine the crime scene exactly as they found it.

4
00:00:25.873 --> 00:00:28.273
So I left it where I found it."

5
00:00:28.274 --> 00:00:32.512
"Let's go look," Henry said. "We should tell Daisy too."

6
00:00:32.513 --> 00:00:37.423
"I just saw her in the barn."

7
00:00:37.424 --> 00:00:41.864
Maggie headed back to the barn with Big Spot. So did Henry.

8
00:00:41.865 --> 00:00:44.870
Daisy and Kira were brushing Coco's mane.

9
00:00:44.871 --> 00:00:48.550
"Maggie found your show shirt," Henry told Daisy.

10
00:00:48.551 --> 00:00:51.874
"Really? Where?" Daisy cried.

11
00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:59.141
"Follow me." Maggie put Big Spot into his stall.

12
00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:01.840
Then she headed out the barn's back door.

13
00:01:01.841 --> 00:01:05.033
She stopped beside the water trough just outside.

14
00:01:05.034 --> 00:01:07.607
"Look!" Maggie said, pointing.

15
00:01:07.608 --> 00:01:10.762
A blob of white fabric was floating in the water.

16
00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:16.847
"My shirt!" Daisy shrieked. She reached in and grabbed the wet shirt.

17
00:01:16.848 --> 00:01:22.692
"Yuck! It's a mess! There's no way I can wear it for my class!"

18
00:01:22.693 --> 00:01:26.370
"Attention, please!" Ms. Wood said over the loudspeaker.

19
00:01:26.371 --> 00:01:29.831
"Riders in the next class, please come to the ring."

20
00:01:29.832 --> 00:01:35.894
"That's us." Kira buttoned her show coat. "We'd better get our ponies."

21
00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:39.485
"Okay." Daisy shoved the wet shirt at Henry.

22
00:01:39.486 --> 00:01:46.307
"You have to find out who did this. Whoever it is should pay!"

23
00:01:46.308 --> 00:01:50.809
The two older girls rushed back into the barn.

24
00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.232
Henry was examining the shirt.

25
00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:57.647
It looked just like Daisy had described, white with a ribbon on the pocket.

26
00:01:57.648 --> 00:02:03.224
"Wow, this shirt is really a mess," he said. "It's not just wet.

27
00:02:03.225 --> 00:02:08.017
It's stained too. There's a spot just below the ribbon."

28
00:02:08.018 --> 00:02:13.026
"Maybe the colors in the ribbon ran when they got wet," Maggie suggested.

29
00:02:13.027 --> 00:02:18.091
"That happened once when I did the laundry. All Dad's underwear turned pink."

30
00:02:18.092 --> 00:02:20.725
"It can't be that," Henry said.

31
00:02:20.726 --> 00:02:25.005
"The ribbon is pink and yellow. This stain is blue."

32
00:02:25.006 --> 00:02:27.790
"Blue?" Maggie looked interested.

33
00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:31.112
"Like the blue stuff Big Spot slobbered on me?"

34
00:02:31.113 --> 00:02:37.919
"Maybe. It's hard to tell, since the shirt has been in the water and the spot is pretty faded."

35
00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.966
"Let me see." Maggie took the shirt. "The stain is right on the pocket.

36
00:02:42.967 --> 00:02:46.708
Maybe something in the pocket is staining it from the inside."

37
00:02:46.709 --> 00:02:49.317
She stuck her fingers into the small pocket.

38
00:02:49.318 --> 00:02:53.438
"Nope, nothing in here. But it feels sticky."

39
00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:58.819
"Maybe Daisy left gum or candy or something in the pocket earlier," Henry said.

40
00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.174
"That makes sense," Maggie said.

41
00:03:01.175 --> 00:03:05.069
"Those lollipops at the Dessert Den come in all kinds of colors.

42
00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:09.112
And Daisy was looking at them yesterday when we saw her there, remember?"

43
00:03:09.113 --> 00:03:14.602
"Daisy was at the Dessert Den yesterday?" Henry said. "I didn't see her."

44
00:03:14.603 --> 00:03:18.840
"She left a few minutes after we got there." Maggie laughed.

45
00:03:18.841 --> 00:03:22.973
"Besides, you were busy drooling over the new chocolate cake.

46
00:03:22.974 --> 00:03:25.350
But Cole and I talked to her."

47
00:03:25.351 --> 00:03:29.500
"So did Daisy buy any blue lollipops?" Henry asked.

48
00:03:29.501 --> 00:03:32.710
"If she didn't, this stain could be a clue."

49
00:03:32.711 --> 00:03:35.852
Maggie shrugged. "Let's go ask her.

50
00:03:35.853 --> 00:03:40.375
If she fed one to Big Spot, that would solve the mystery of the blue drool."

51
00:03:40.376 --> 00:03:45.697
"Yeah. But it wouldn't explain who took Daisy's shirt," Henry said.

52
00:03:45.698 --> 00:03:49.046
"Big Spot couldn't have put it in the water trough."

53
00:03:49.047 --> 00:03:54.081
They walked to the ring. "Daisy's class already started," Maggie said.

54
00:03:54.082 --> 00:03:55.427
Henry nodded.

55
00:03:55.428 --> 00:03:59.797
He watched as Daisy, Kira, and several other students rode around the ring.

56
00:03:59.798 --> 00:04:07.430
In the end Daisy won the blue ribbon, and Kira came in second.

57
00:04:07.431 --> 00:04:12.194
"That was great!" Daisy exclaimed as she and Kira rode out of the ring.

58
00:04:12.195 --> 00:04:16.026
"Hey, Kira, let's enter another class in the show.

59
00:04:16.027 --> 00:04:19.252
How about the obstacle course class?"

60
00:04:19.253 --> 00:04:23.005
"I can't," Kira said. "I don't have enough money."

61
00:04:23.006 --> 00:04:25.836
"I know how that feels," Maggie told her.

62
00:04:25.837 --> 00:04:29.270
Then she turned to Daisy. "Can we talk to you?"

63
00:04:29.271 --> 00:04:35.715
"Sure. I'll catch up to you in the barn," Daisy told Kira.

64
00:04:35.716 --> 00:04:39.058
She followed Henry and Maggie to a more private spot.

65
00:04:39.059 --> 00:04:43.576
"What's up? Did you guys figure out who wrecked my shirt?"

66
00:04:43.577 --> 00:04:46.512
She didn't sound as angry as she had earlier.

67
00:04:46.513 --> 00:04:50.384
Henry guessed that she was in a good mood after winning her class.

68
00:04:50.385 --> 00:04:55.790
"Not exactly," he said. "But we noticed a blue stain on the pocket.

69
00:04:55.791 --> 00:04:58.633
Did you put anything blue in there?"

70
00:04:58.634 --> 00:05:03.728
"Like one of those blue lollipops from the Dessert Den, for instance?" Maggie said.

71
00:05:03.729 --> 00:05:06.348
"Did you bring one to feed to Coco?"

72
00:05:06.349 --> 00:05:08.526
Daisy looked surprised.

73
00:05:08.527 --> 00:05:13.268
"I love those lollipops, especially the blueberry ones.

74
00:05:13.269 --> 00:05:16.551
But they're much too expensive to feed to ponies!

75
00:05:16.552 --> 00:05:22.547
I didn't even buy any yesterday. I wanted to save my money for today's show."

76
00:05:22.548 --> 00:05:27.370
"Oh," Maggie said. "Hey, I think Kira is calling you.

77
00:05:27.371 --> 00:05:29.666
You'd better see what she wants."

78
00:05:29.667 --> 00:05:37.504
"She is? Okay, see you guys later!" Daisy hurried off with her pony.

79
00:05:37.505 --> 00:05:42.923
"Why'd you say that?" Henry said. "I wanted to ask her more questions."

80
00:05:42.924 --> 00:05:46.685
"Because I just thought of a new theory," Maggie blurted out.

81
00:05:46.686 --> 00:05:53.252
"Maybe the person who wrecked Daisy's shirt is . . . Daisy!"
